cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  glioma_physicell: a replicate-run and analysis harness for agent-based
  astrocytoma simulation
message: If you use this software, please cite it and the works it depends on.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Vedant
    family-names: Dave
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/glioma_physicell"
abstract: >-
  A harness for running seeded PhysiCell replicates of a two-dimensional
  agent-based astrocytoma model and reducing them to replicate-level outcomes.
  Parameters are held in a single registry that emits both the PhysiCell
  configuration and the manuscript parameter table, with per-parameter
  provenance (measured, calculated, assumed, or software default) enforced at
  load time. Includes monoculture, well-mixed, position-swapped and
  identical-parameter label-control arms; within-seed paired contrasts with
  bootstrap confidence intervals; a replicate-count convergence check; and a
  closed-form expectation check against N(t) = N0 exp((r - d) t).
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - PhysiCell
  - glioma
  - astrocytoma
  - IDH1
  - TP53
  - reproducibility

